 "html": "<img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/news/6a671256891b3.png\">\n<p>2026年度 社會組 職棋甄選-決賽，本日(7/28)進行第二天的賽事</p>\n<p>第四輪賽後</p>\n<p>林秉寬 取得4勝0負，下一場輪空後、後續賽程只要再拿一勝，即確定晉升新科職棋</p>\n<p>姬孝天、陳雲亮 取得3勝1負，努力緊追在後</p>\n<p>詳細戰績如下：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1njMrOPknRXuhUCb-u85yqIWCmWi8q--y/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=109592947956016408064&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\">社會組 職棋甄選-決賽 成績表</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/2026%E5%B9%B4%20%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8%20%E6%B1%BA%E8%B3%BD_page-0001%20%281%29.jpg\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260728_3.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260728_4.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260728_2.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260728_1.jpg\"></p>"
